                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo ndipo waliposema, Njoni na tufanye mashauri juu ya Yeremia; maana sheria haitampotea kuhani, wala shauri halitampotea mwenye hekima, wala neno halitampotea nabii. Njoni, na tumpige kwa ndimi zetu, wala tusiyaangalie maneno yake yo yote.",
          "type": "text",
